        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: இழுப்பறை",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இழுப்பறை — iḻuppaṟai — \"a drawer\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சாவி மேசையின் இழுப்பறையில் இருக்கிறது. cāvi mēcaiyiṉ iḻuppaṟaiyil irukkiṟatu. The key is in the desk drawer."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Word for word \"a pull-room\": இழு (iḻu) \"to pull\" + அறை (aṟai) \"a room\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இழுப்பறை (iḻuppaṟai) is a native compound: இழு (iḻu), \"to pull, to draw\" (DEDR 504), and அறை (aṟai), \"a room, a compartment\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
